        "title_info": "\"Coffee is just the Vehicle, the real mission is the people\"",
        "color_title_info": "#556b2f",
        "content_info": "At Iron Soldiers Coffee Company, our mission is clear: to support veterans by providing them with more than just a cup of coffee, but a symbol of camaraderie, resilience, and community. We are dedicated to crafting fresh, roast-to-order coffee that not only fuels your day but also fuels our commitment to giving back to those who have served. With every sip, you're not just enjoying a premium blend; you're standing in solidarity with our veterans, honoring their sacrifice, and supporting them and their families. Join us in our mission to serve those who have served us, one delicious cup at a time.",
        "color_content_info": "#556b2f",
        "more_about": "More about us",
        "url_banner": "shopify://pages/about-us",
        "margin_top": "36",
